  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, Direct and Indirect containers are created by providing RDF (as the original PUT/POST or via PATCH) that includes a triple of the form:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<> a <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "That approach should be disallowed. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Instead, the user should only be able to create a Direct container by POSTing or PUTing a new resource with a `Link` header as:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "``Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">; rel=\"type\"```",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Likewise, the user should only be able to create an Indirect container by POSTing or PUTing a new resource with a `Link` header as:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "``Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">; rel=\"type\"``` ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Note: Since Basic, Direct and Indirect containers do not inherit from one another, clients should not be able to change a container's type from one to another.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "e.g. Clients should not be able to change a Basic container to a Direct container.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "See: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://www.w3.org/TR/ldp/#fig-ldpc-types"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://www.w3.org/TR/ldp/#fig-ldpc-types",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
